### Current `main` first · Central Commerce deferred

**Status:** Revised — initial conversion is current `main` only; central commerce is a later port  
**Date:** 2026-11-14  
**Target repo:** `https://github.com/MahmudulHasanRiaz/EcoMate.git` (new, empty, public)  
**Source repo:** `https://github.com/MahmudulHasanRiaz/EcoMate-Web.git` (existing single-tenant product)  
