| Feature gating | Reuse existing `@RequiresFeature` gates and feature keys; replace license source with entitlement snapshot |
| Storefront | **One Next.js app, host-based tenant resolution**, tenant-scoped cache tags; per-tenant containers are a later scale lever |
| Platform stack | New `apps/platform-api` (NestJS), `apps/platform-admin` (Vite React), `apps/landing` (Next.js) |
| Git strategy | Push current `main` to new repo first (full history), tag `single-tenant-baseline`, convert on `main`. |
| Central Commerce port | **Deferred** until `feat/central-commerce` is finished upstream. Then additive migrations with tenantId/RLS from day one; no backfill. |
| Primary domain | `SAAS_PRIMARY_DOMAIN=ecomate.bd` |
